Create a fresh sandbox, get a usable shell 381 ms, 30 out of 30 tries worked the same speed. Then 100 simultaneous sandbox starts 680 ms avg 100 / 100 successful 100 distinct machines running at once!&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mainbrella.com/" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://mainbrella.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/mainbrella/backend" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://github.com/mainbrella/backend&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/mainbrella/web" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://github.com/mainbrella/web&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;Looking for feedback, feature requests and yes our first paying customers who we will cherish!&lt;p&gt;Thank you HN!
-Andrew Arrow&lt;/p&gt;
